  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID/Ethiopia Highlands Resilience Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Feed the Future Ethiopia Highlands Resilience Activity (HRA) aims to enable 120,000 households in the highland regions of Ethiopia to reach the graduation threshold from the Government of Ethiopia (GoE) Productive Safety Net Program (PSNP5).</narrative>
  </description>
